"🌲 grove capacity (token cost over N min)
   ├─ tokens, fleet-wide: ⚪ unread as a fleet sum — unreached: grove-sandpine-vN unreadable; each grove row below names why
   │  ├─ per crew-hour: behavior ⚪ · directive ⚪
