   │  └─ 7d: ⚪ the cap ledger holds no rows — wire \`claude.statusline.caplog\` on each seat, then restart it
   └─ grove-sandpine-vN: 💥 unreadable — no slot — exit <rc>: ssh: <the resolver says why>

🥥 next
